  "summary": {
    "as": "Introduced in House",
    "asOf": "2026-07-13",
    "date": "2026-09-02T22:40:31Z",
    "text": "Medicare Access to Rural Anesthesiology Act\n\nThis bill modifies the Medicare payment methodology for anesthesiologists in rural hospitals.\n\nSpecifically, the bill provides that payment must be made on a reasonable cost basis for anesthesiologists in rural hospitals and critical access hospitals that have no more than 800 surgical procedures requiring anesthesia services per year (or a higher number set by the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services)."
  },
